WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.959
Writers choose a format for their audience and build a main idea with supporting

00:00:04.959 --> 00:00:05.299
details.

00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:11.173
Which sentence is a topic sentence? Answer: Our school garden needs regular care.

00:00:12.033 --> 00:00:15.724
Plan a paragraph about water conservation for a school noticeboard.

00:00:16.533 --> 00:00:20.821
Discuss why: A topic sentence introduces the paragraph's main point.
